@startuml
title Microwave Oven State Diagram

state Start <<entry>> {
  entry / Initial state
}

state Waiting {
  entry / Display current time
}

state UserInput {
  entry / Ready for input (power selection or time)
}

state Cooking {
  do / Operate at selected power level
}

state DoorOpenInactive {
  entry / Deactivate due to open door
}

state Stopped <<exit>> {
  entry / Stop operation and reset
}

[*] --> Start

Start --> Waiting

Waiting --> UserInput : User interaction (power selection or time input)

UserInput --> Cooking : Start cooking process

Cooking -->
| Door opened | DoorOpenInactive

Cooking -->
| Cancel | Stopped

DoorOpenInactive -->
| Resumed | Waiting  # This transition isn't explicitly mentioned but implied by returning to waiting after door is closed.

Waiting -->
| User interaction | UserInput

UserInput -->
| Cancel | Stopped

DoorOpenInactive --> Stopped : Power off or system reset

Stopped --> [*]
@enduml
